IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sgb2-s172-liability-of-officers`

-- Tests for ss 172, 172A and 172B. Every expected value is written from the text, beside the assertion, before it was run.

§ `s 172(1) to (3): provisions that are void`

#ASSERT `s 172(1) the provision purporting to exempt an officer from liability is void` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172(1) the provision purporting to exempt an officer from liability is void` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2): void, except as permitted by s 172A or 172B.
#ASSERT `s 172(2) the provision for an indemnity is void` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172(2) the provision for an indemnity is void` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172(2) the provision for an indemnity is void` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 172(2) the provision for an indemnity is void` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3): constitution, contract "or otherwise": every place is covered.
#ASSERT `s 172(3) the section applies to the provision` `s 172(3) in the company's constitution` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172(3) the section applies to the provision` `s 172(3) in a contract with the company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172(3) the section applies to the provision` `s 172(3) otherwise` EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `s 172A: insurance`

#ASSERT `s 172A the insurance is within the exception from section 172(2)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172A the insurance is within the exception from section 172(2)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 172B: third party indemnity`

-- Arguments: liability to a person other than the company; (a)(i) a criminal fine; (a)(ii) a regulatory penalty; (b)(i) defending criminal proceedings ending in conviction; (b)(ii) defending a civil claim ending in judgment against the officer; (b)(iii) a refused application for relief.
#ASSERT `s 172B(1) the provision for indemnity is within the exception from section 172(2)` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Liability to the company itself: the "where" fails.
#ASSERT `s 172B(1) the provision for indemnity is within the exception from section 172(2)` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Each of the five excepted liabilities takes the indemnity out of the exception.
#ASSERT `s 172B(1) the provision for indemnity is within the exception from section 172(2)` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172B(1) the provision for indemnity is within the exception from section 172(2)` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172B(1) the provision for indemnity is within the exception from section 172(2)` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172B(1) the provision for indemnity is within the exception from section 172(2)` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172B(1) the provision for indemnity is within the exception from section 172(2)` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (3)(a): not appealed: final at the end of the period for bringing an appeal. Appealed: final when the appeal is disposed of.
#ASSERT `s 172B(3)(a) the day the conviction, judgment or refusal of relief becomes final` FALSE (Date 30 6 2026) (Date 15 9 2026) EQUALS Date 30 6 2026
#ASSERT `s 172B(3)(a) the day the conviction, judgment or refusal of relief becomes final` TRUE (Date 30 6 2026) (Date 15 9 2026) EQUALS Date 15 9 2026
-- (3)(b): determined with no further appeal: the day it is determined; with a right of further appeal: when the period for it has ended; abandoned: the day it was abandoned.
#ASSERT `s 172B(3)(b) the day the appeal (or further appeal) is disposed of` `s 172B(3)(b)(i) it was determined` (Date 1 8 2026) FALSE (Date 31 8 2026) (Date 5 8 2026) EQUALS Date 1 8 2026
#ASSERT `s 172B(3)(b) the day the appeal (or further appeal) is disposed of` `s 172B(3)(b)(i) it was determined` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE (Date 31 8 2026) (Date 5 8 2026) EQUALS Date 31 8 2026
#ASSERT `s 172B(3)(b) the day the appeal (or further appeal) is disposed of` `s 172B(3)(b)(ii) it was abandoned or otherwise ceased to have effect` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE (Date 31 8 2026) (Date 5 8 2026) EQUALS Date 5 8 2026
-- (2): the decision is the final decision from the day it becomes final.
#ASSERT `s 172B(2) the conviction, judgment or refusal of relief is the final decision on the day` (Date 30 6 2026) (Date 30 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172B(2) the conviction, judgment or refusal of relief is the final decision on the day` (Date 30 6 2026) (Date 29 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172B(2) the conviction, judgment or refusal of relief is the final decision on the day` (Date 30 6 2026) (Date 1 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (4): the applications referred to.
#ASSERT `s 172B(4) the application is an application for relief referred to in subsection (1)(b)(iii)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172B(4) the application is an application for relief referred to in subsection (1)(b)(iii)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172B(4) the application is an application for relief referred to in subsection (1)(b)(iii)` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
